        "id": "DSD_QGFS",
        "name": "Quarterly Government Finance Statistics (QGFS)",
        "names": {
          "en": "Quarterly Government Finance Statistics (QGFS)"
        },
        "description": "The Government Finance Statistics (GFS) includes government revenues and expenditures, government net lending / net borrowing (the surplus / deficit) financing transactions and balance sheet data on governemnt assets and liabilities.  Statistics are available for different levels of government including central general government, state general government and local general government.   ",
